    "The Dock exposes Spaces bar buttons with the label in AXTitle (Desktop N, TextEdit) and an action phrase in AXDescription (exit to Desktop N).",
    "An Apple Events permission prompt for TextEdit blocked the first run; the harness switched to LaunchServices for activation and was left unanswered, so no permission was granted or denied."
